{"review_date":"2026-10-04","window_days":7,"regime":"Correcting","created_at":"2026-10-04T12:00:26.782059+00:00","summary":"✅ *Working*\n• `audit_errors.open_total` = 0 of 10 events this week. All 10 are dispositioned `quiet` and none has recurred in 4–6 days.\n• `judge_weekly`: 3 of 3 alerts judged, 0 fallbacks, 3 judge-driven. The pipeline ran without degradation.\n• Alpaca/Benzinga news attribution is 100% (3/3) with density median 14, up from 50% and 7 last week. n=3, so this is directional only.\n\n⚠️ *Anomalies to verify* — UNVERIFIED; do NOT act before checking ground truth\n• `anomalies.l1_invariants` = 1 (`silent_audit_error_window`), the same key as last week. `audit_errors.total` rose from 2 to 10, and 8 of the 10 are theme-pipeline events (6 `theme_parent_pass_error`, 1 `theme_synthesis_error`, 1 `assignment_error`). All 8 are on 09-29 and none has recurred since. This may be already-resolved or designed. Check it against audit ground truth.\n• `theme_churn.total_high_churn_pairs` = 20, the same as the prior two weeks. This week's pairs are all 2 adds / 2 removes in Offshore Drilling and Appalachian Gas themes. `cooldowns.triggered_this_week` = 38 (active 71) versus 33 (active 62) last week. The cause is unknown. It could be a designed mechanism or a known-in-flight task.\n• `ep_outcomes`: 3 alerts, 1 traded, 2 filtered. The 0% by-tier and by-catalyst rates are the alert cohort's fwd_1w hit rate, not trade outcomes, and the traded cohort is N=1, which is noise. Separately, TJGC (filtered on `session_rvol` 0.20x) had `max_high_5d` +35.8%. That may be a designed gate working as intended.\n\n🔁 *Last week:* All three prior anomalies persisted: the L1 invariant count is 1→1, the churn pairs 20→20, and the traded cohort moved 0→1 (still too small to read). None improved.\n\n📉 *Drift:*\ncooldowns_per_day: 1→2 (13.0 vs p50 2.0)\ncooldowns_per_day: 2→1 (0.0 vs p50 2.0)\ntheme_count_active: 1→2 (122.0 vs p50 115.0)\n\n📄 *Docs drift (unverified):*\n• `docs/setups/exit_discipline.md:665`: dated status claim, nothing can verify it; re-check by hand.\n• `docs/setups/magna53_ep.md:129`: deployment-status assertion nothing can verify; tie it to a flag or date.\n• `docs/setups/magna53_ep.md:565`: dated status claim, nothing can verify it; re-check by hand.","suggestions":["`anomalies.l1_invariants` = 1 (`silent_audit_error_window`), the same key as last week. `audit_errors.total` rose from 2 to 10, and 8 of the 10 are theme-pipeline events (6 `theme_parent_pass_error`, 1 `theme_synthesis_error`, 1 `assignment_error`). All 8 are on 09-29 and none has recurred since. This may be already-resolved or designed. Check it against audit ground truth.", "`theme_churn.total_high_churn_pairs` = 20, the same as the prior two weeks. This week's pairs are all 2 adds / 2 removes in Offshore Drilling and Appalachian Gas themes. `cooldowns.triggered_this_week` = 38 (active 71) versus 33 (active 62) last week. The cause is unknown. It could be a designed mechanism or a known-in-flight task.", "`ep_outcomes`: 3 alerts, 1 traded, 2 filtered. The 0% by-tier and by-catalyst rates are the alert cohort's fwd_1w hit rate, not trade outcomes, and the traded cohort is N=1, which is noise. Separately, TJGC (filtered on `session_rvol` 0.20x) had `max_high_5d` +35.8%. That may be a designed gate working as intended."],"metrics":{"wick": {"n_total": 6, "n_filled": 0, "fill_rate": null, "n_settled": 0, "median_fwd_3d_from_high": null, "median_fwd_3d_from_close": null}, "crypto": {"is_live": true, "verdict": "⚠️ not ready: 1 crypto_ingest_error events in last 7d", "blockers": ["1 crypto_ingest_error events in last 7d"], "pre_arm_7d": 5, "shadow_mode": false, "ready_to_flip": false, "universe_size": 340, "last_trigger_at": null, "rs_history_days": 149, "watchlist_total": 27, "categories_pairs": 2780, "ingest_errors_7d": 1, "ingest_attempts_7d": 7, "macro_history_days": 149, "watchlist_unresolved": 0, "stablecoin_history_days": 149}, "regime": {"current": "Correcting", "ep_threshold": 75, "transitions_this_week": 0}, "report": {"needs_me": 1, "needs_you": 4, "fold_chars": 7883, "head_lines": 12, "suppressed": [{"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:03 ET)", "what": "theme_parent_pass_error at 2026-09-29T21:03:07.216418+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:03 ET)", "what": "theme_parent_pass_error at 2026-09-29T21:03:08.589432+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:03 ET)", "what": "theme_parent_pass_error at 2026-09-29T21:03:10.642377+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:03 ET)", "what": "theme_parent_pass_error at 2026-09-29T21:03:12.066960+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:03 ET)", "what": "theme_parent_pass_error at 2026-09-29T21:03:14.620707+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:03 ET)", "what": "theme_parent_pass_error at 2026-09-29T21:03:18.287433+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 18:05 ET)", "what": "theme_synthesis_error at 2026-09-29T22:05:10.872051+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 18:00 ET)", "what": "crypto_ingest_error at 2026-09-29T22:00:00.138254+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: StructuredOutputError has not recurred in 4d (Tue 09-29 17:01 ET)", "what": "assignment_error at 2026-09-29T21:01:46.469495+00:00"}, {"rule": "quiet: it has not recurred in 6d (Mon 09-28 07:00 ET)", "what": "judge_divergence_check_failed at 2026-09-28T11:00:33.019882+00:00"}, {"rule": "held by operator ruling — no data can change it, so it is not pending", "what": "wick_fill promotion blocker"}], "needs_me_lines": ["judge 2nd-opinion disagreement is over the 25% review bar this week — I run the grounding check (#301)"], "needs_you_lines": ["• *Catalyst-discovery loop (investigator + advisor) — C2/C3 build sequencing gate (ADR 0006)* _[ripe 3d]_ · written 2026-05-30, 10 rule changes since (latest 2026-09-06) — re-check the question against the live rule — Build per ADR 0006 §7 smallest-viable sequence: (1) cohort accessor + RS-slope filter (reuse correlation_engine + mi_stock_scores rs_1m/rs_6m), (2) rung-1 investigator on a SINGLE case, (3) rung-1.5 advisor pass (Sonnet critique + bounded revise), (4) nightly job + mi_catalyst_dossiers + Telegram surface (advisory/shadow).", "• *L2 baseline window too sluggish for trending metrics (earnings-season transitions)* _[ripe 3d]_ · written 2026-05-20, 10 rule changes since (latest 2026-09-06) — re-check the question against the live rule — With ≥6 L2 events in last 90d, categorize each: - FP (false positive, metric in transition): supports change - TP (real anomaly correctly surfaced): cautions against window change If ≥4 of 6 are FPs from trending-metric class: Phase 1 — Telemetry-only ship: tag each L2 with a `trending` classifier (monotonic-3-of-5d?, regression slope?) and emit an audit event for FP-likely L2s.", "• *Steady-state cost of theme assignment after the 08-10 output-bounding fix — does the backlog cost decay, and…* _[ripe 3d]_ · written 2026-08-10, 8 rule changes since (latest 2026-09-06) — re-check the question against the live rule — Report cost/night and uncovered-pool size/night AS A PAIR (cost alone is uninterpretable — it is ~73 output tokens per unassigned stock, so it must be read against the pool), plus the trend and implied monthly run-rate.", "• *Ranking rule — RUNNING out-of-sample read (converted 2026-08-18 from a single 2026-10-15 gate)* · written 2026-08-16, 7 rule changes since (latest 2026-09-06) — re-check the question against the live rule — RUNNING READ — fires again every session a new out-of-sample alert_date lands, from the first one."]}, "window": {"end": "2026-10-04", "days": 7, "start": "2026-09-27"}, "clusters": {"count_today": 0, "avg_cohesion": null}, "anomalies": {"l3_drifts": {"count": 6, "transitions": [{"key": "cooldowns_per_day", "p50": 2.0, "current": 13.0, "to_band": 2, "from_band": 1}, {"key": "cooldowns_per_day", "p50": 2.0, "current": 0.0, "to_band": 1, "from_band": 2}, {"key": "cooldowns_per_day", "p50": 2.0, "current": 11.0, "to_band": 2, "from_band": 1}, {"key": "theme_count_active", "p50": 115.0, "current": 122.0, "to_band": 2, "from_band": 1}, {"key": "cooldowns_per_day", "p50": 2.0, "current": 0.0, "to_band": 1, "from_band": 2}, {"key": "cooldowns_per_day", "p50": 2.0, "current": 14.0, "to_band": 2, "from_band": 1}]}, "l2_anomalies": {"count": 0, "by_key": []}, "l1_invariants": {"count": 1, "by_key": [{"key": "silent_audit_error_window", "count": 1}]}}, "cooldowns": {"recent": [{"theme": "Orthopedic Surgical Devices & Instruments", "reason": "Description 'Medical device components, interventional products' does not match theme", "ticker": "MMSI"}, {"theme": "AI data-center power buildout", "reason": "Description 'Content delivery, web security, CDN' does not match theme", "ticker": "AKAM"}, {"theme": "Enterprise HR & Workforce Management SaaS", "reason": "Description 'Cloud HR software, payroll & HCM services' does not match theme", "ticker": "PAYC"}], "active_count": 71, "triggered_this_week": 38}, "shadow_orb": {"entered": 1, "by_shape": [], "no_entry": 1, "gate_blocked": 1, "paired_closed_total": 0}, "drift_check": {"drift_n": 2, "checked_at": "2026-10-03 22:02:03.760366+00:00", "unverified_n": 8, "prod_reachable": true, "unverified_claims": [{"where": "docs/setups/exit_discipline.md:665", "words": "A status claim in a dated entry that is still the doc's most recent word on its subject, and nothing can verify it — the exact shape that rotted on 2026-08-23. Re-check by hand; tie it to a flag or add a superseding entry."}, {"where": "docs/setups/magna53_ep.md:129", "words": "A deployment-status assertion nothing can verify — exactly the kind of line that rotted on 2026-08-23. Re-check it by hand and tie it to a flag or date."}, {"where": "docs/setups/magna53_ep.md:565", "words": "A status claim in a dated entry that is still the doc's most recent